Subject: [PATCH 887/905] [Huawei] Backport legacy percpu-rwsem locking for
 cgroup

Offering: HULK
hulk inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: NA

Reference: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/tree/kernel/locking/percpu-rwsem.c?id=7111951b8d4973bda27ff663f2cf18b663d15b48

